stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Statements hold 0 units, manager holds 0
  s1: Statements hold 1 units, manager holds 1
  s2: Statements hold 2 units, manager holds 2
  s3: Both statements released
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Reserve one unit
  s1 --> s0: Close one statement
  s1 --> s2: Reserve one unit
  s0 --> s3: Close one statement
  s2 --> s1: Close one statement
  s1 --> s3: Close one statement
